The code in this repository is MIT licensed (above). The data in data/ is derived from third-party
sources under their own licences; full texts are in LICENSES/:

- Unicode CLDR (names, currencies, languages, locale data, subdivisions): Unicode-3.0.
  Copyright (c) 1991-2026 Unicode, Inc.
- Google libphonenumber metadata (phone rules) and Google address metadata (address formats):
  Apache-2.0. Copyright (C) 2009 The Libphonenumber Authors; Copyright (C) Google Inc.
  These files were modified: reduced to the fields worldref publishes and reshaped to its format.
- World Bank World Development Indicators (population, area): CC-BY-4.0. Source: The World Bank.
- Wikidata (capitals, coordinates, aliases, plugs, voltage, sports codes, nationality forms): CC0-1.0.
- CIA World Factbook (English nationality, official names): public domain.
- IANA Time Zone Database and root zone list: public domain.
- flag-icons (SVG flags): MIT, Copyright (c) 2013 Panayiotis Lipiridis.
- Website fonts in site/assets/fonts (IBM Plex Sans Arabic, Noto Kufi Arabic, JetBrains Mono): OFL-1.1.

Per-column sources, versions and every editorial decision are listed in data/sources.json.
